\"uploadDate\":\"2015-10-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Renault UK Service"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>I was asked by Renault to voice a series of videos highlighting their servicing products.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Renault explainer videos</h2>\r\n<p>I've never actually owned a Renault. Not for any reason, but I never got round to it. However, I saw the animation and did some more research into the company and said yes, this ad is for me!<br>\r\nThis is another one of my conversational voices. It's natural but gets the message across to the target audience.\r\nShort videos like this can engage the viewer better, as long as the product's appeal is simple. Check out my <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover showreel</a> for more examples. For a more complex product, you may need to take more time to explain the product; check out my <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video showreel</a>!</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/o1K-OdQFxL8","title":"Renault UK Service","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/renault-uk-service.jpg","alt":"Renault UK Service","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br>\r\n<h2>More about Renault Servicing</h2>\r\n<p>As the say, Who better than <a href=\"/https://www.renault.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Renault\">Renault</a> to care for your Renault?<br>\r\nBenefits of a Renault service:\r\nSafety - full vehicle health check\r\nReliability - Renault approved parts\r\nTransparency - Fixed price on Service and Maintenance\r\nCustomer excellence - vehicles returned washed and clean, and all repairs benefit from 1 year guarantee on parts and labour.<br>\r\n</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you have a product that needs an explainer video voice, then do get in touch. To make the process even easier, just let me know the intended usage of the project and I can quote you more accurately. Feel free to send a short sample of the script and I'd be more than happy to send you a short audition to check if my voice is right for your show or project.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Renault UK Service","pageUrl":"renault-uk-service"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","883",{"href":"/the-official-voice-of-santa","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/official-voice-of-santa-guy-harris.jpg","alt":"the-official-voice-of-santa","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Guy Harris is the Of